{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "钥匙都在",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 46.54,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2024 年 7 月，交易所 WazirX 的多签冷钱包，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 7 月，交易所 WazirX 的多签冷钱包，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 8.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "冷钱包放的是大部分资产，多签就是为了不让一把钥匙说了算。",
   "spoken": "冷钱包放的是大部分资产，多签就是为了不让一把钥匙说了算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 8.46,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 8.558,
   "speechEnd": 13.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这个钱包有六把钥匙，转账要其中四把签名。",
   "spoken": "这个钱包有六把钥匙，转账要其中四把签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 13.96,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 14.055,
   "speechEnd": 17.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "公开材料没有说，任何一把私钥被导出。",
   "spoken": "公开材料没有说，任何一把私钥被导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 17.86,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 17.86,
   "speechEnd": 20.616
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "签名人按流程，一个一个签了名。",
   "spoken": "签名人按流程，一个一个签了名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 21.04,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 21.13,
   "speechEnd": 24.051
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "攻击者没有偷走钥匙，却让这些钥匙替他签了字。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没有偷走钥匙，却让这些钥匙替他签了字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.46,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 24.46,
   "speechEnd": 28.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "钥匙都在，钱没了。",
   "spoken": "钥匙都在，钱没了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 29.16,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 29.16,
   "speechEnd": 31.19
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "多数大额事故，都不是私钥被数学破解。",
   "spoken": "多数大额事故，都不是私钥被数学破解。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 31.62,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 31.718,
   "speechEnd": 34.955
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 35.36,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 35.36,
   "speechEnd": 36.161
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "六把私钥都存在硬件钱包里，一把也没有泄露。",
   "spoken": "六把私钥都存在硬件钱包里，一把也没有泄露。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 36.62,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 36.62,
   "speechEnd": 40.3
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "攻击者能转走多签里的资金吗？",
   "spoken": "攻击者能转走多签里的资金吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 40.76,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 40.859,
   "speechEnd": 43.381
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "先记住这个问题。",
   "spoken": "先记住这个问题。",
